{"title":"2024 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Apex_STEM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Apex STEM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_by_Power_Solve\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2 by Power Solve</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3 by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_4_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 4 by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_5_by_Pi_Academy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 5 by Pi Academy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_6_by_Dr._David\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 6 by Dr. David</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_7_by_Easy_Way\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 7 by Easy Way</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Amy, Bomani, Charlie, and Daria work in a chocolate factory. On Monday Amy, Bomani, and Charlie started working at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/c/7acc2792fcea531d44bc4d9e5679bae52e63bd63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1:00 \\ \\mathrm{PM}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"14\" /> and were able to pack <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> packages, respectively, every <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes. At some later time, Daria joined the group, and Daria was able to pack <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> packages every <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes. Together, they finished packing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/3/4739126bff84658daf38a400b94af84c72f11fa0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$450$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> packages at exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/0/b00e441e284b77b03a4d551aac6a28c880521948.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2:45\\ \\mathrm{PM}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"14\" />. At what time did Daria join the group?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7da246f1d1994edee6f5e51a50938a561ff68ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }1:25\\text{ PM}\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }1:35\\text{ PM}\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }1:45\\text{ PM}\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }1:55\\text{ PM}\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }2:05\\text{ PM}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"682\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that Amy, Bomani, and Charlie pack a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/8/f984c2c27db263fc80f9c6c91295b7ca0c0ecf1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4+3+3=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"116\" height=\"15\" /> packages every <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes.\n</p><p>The total amount of time worked is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hour and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27da4fca6f3fecb215974023aad210b70ec3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes, which when converted to minutes, is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/1/791f15f656db201fa9116a2f762a4b292fc50883.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$105$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> minutes. This means that since Amy, Bomani, and Charlie worked for the entire <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/1/791f15f656db201fa9116a2f762a4b292fc50883.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$105$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> minutes, they in total packed <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4f46fb562117fd9e187260995b7c57cf32e1d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{105}{3}\\cdot10=350$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"116\" height=\"38\" /> packages.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/3/4739126bff84658daf38a400b94af84c72f11fa0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$450$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> packages were packed in total, then Daria must have packed <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/3/8335277a2aae18a233af098045c4d0cd65bdaf24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$450-350=100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"15\" /> packages in total, and since she packs at a rate of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> packages per <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes, then Daria worked for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/0/ff0956eba19263c222df5d1d0ada7c2533d5c6ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{100}{5}\\cdot4=80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"98\" height=\"38\" /> minutes, therefore Daria joined <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea5fcc6d66685ee21f722efcd228eb44d38f262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes before <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/e/d7e2db63c247c8f5bc9d771baf7685bcd3af9d19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2:45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> PM, which was at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/9/ed94250f3bad1b9bff3829be3be26883bc7f3c2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }1:25\\text{ PM}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"123\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~Tacos_are_yummy_1, andliu766\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the time, in minutes, elapsed between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/0/f20dfdfc254c89ac76fc16cc9a4e1d6da0e5bab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1:00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> and the time Daria joined the packaging be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Since Amy packages <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> packages every <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes, she packages <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/3/7b33bd495b7492f95385da7afb197cd34638cdfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> packages per minute. Similarly, we can see that both Bomani and Charlie package <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> package per minute, and Daria packages <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/2/3628e955d7e4a0e6322ada48bc33c003f9b25dbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" /> packages every minute.\n</p><p>Before Daria arrives, we can write the total packages packaged as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/9/1b9da50ad832285544edb9b049295b75023c6ddf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x(\\frac{4}{3} + 1 + 1) = x(\\frac{10}{3})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"173\" height=\"38\" />. Since there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/1/791f15f656db201fa9116a2f762a4b292fc50883.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$105$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> minutes between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/0/f20dfdfc254c89ac76fc16cc9a4e1d6da0e5bab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1:00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/e/d7e2db63c247c8f5bc9d771baf7685bcd3af9d19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2:45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, Daria works with the other three for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/5/c757adc0b9987ea6d2a380b6908fb5bc539ec242.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$105-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" /> minutes, meaning for that time there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/4/d54a1b61018ad3599277bd666b91dfc126ab0eb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(105-x)(\\frac{4}{3} + 1 + 1 + \\frac{5}{4}) = (105-x)(\\frac{55}{12})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"336\" height=\"38\" /> packages packaged. \n</p><p>Adding the two, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/4/054f25210487e32373d2d6fa0b100774397c01c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x(\\frac{10}{3}) + (105-x)(\\frac{55}{12}) = 450$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"233\" height=\"38\" /> (The total packaged in the entire time is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/3/4739126bff84658daf38a400b94af84c72f11fa0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$450$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />). Solving this equation, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/f/08f7cfaaaac737ada39fc1450e9a5319e01a9038.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=25$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />, meaning Daria arrived <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes after <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/0/f20dfdfc254c89ac76fc16cc9a4e1d6da0e5bab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1:00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, meaning the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/9/ed94250f3bad1b9bff3829be3be26883bc7f3c2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }1:25\\text{ PM}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"123\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~i_am_suk_at_math_2\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Apex_STEM\">Video Solution by Apex STEM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Apex STEM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/RICkLplwFQQ\">https://youtu.be/RICkLplwFQQ</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/3KlgZnQVmlg\">https://youtu.be/3KlgZnQVmlg</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/l3VrUsZkv8I\">https://youtu.be/l3VrUsZkv8I</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2_by_Power_Solve\">Video